          "name": "getFullMarketIntelligence",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:4c068eebfca5cc7974223227f5795c60fae4df40f0e3b7eda00a356898fcd3de",
          "description": "Everything in ONE call.\n\nReturns ALL intelligence layers for ALL tracked symbols:\nClimate + Ignition + Heatmap + XFlow + Composite Score.\n\nIncludes `action_summary` — a quick-lookup per-symbol map with `action`,\n`direction_bias`, `risk`, `composite_score`, and `verdict`.\n\nThis is the ultimate endpoint for dashboards and AI agents\nthat need complete market context in a single request.\n",
